{
  "id": "2KI.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "2 Sugoodiga 14",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amasiya sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba iyeenya bea Yehoashi orjeeda Yehoahasi was sugoocheanda Israeli. Hean ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda Yuda Amasiya was orjeeda Yoashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gaba gweanyeew diktam ea muut, damanda ang'eada sugoocheanduumeeda, ak ghwaak gweanyeew diktam ea shagheash aba Yerusalemu. Ak gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Yehoadani bea Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea miyaasiin aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak ea mawuurji ghwaan was Dawdi, ak gwasin sean gawuurji gidasinda ghwaan was Yoashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heeda siwadiini ghadooweeda ea miyeenyarja, inyeesa buuneeda ghoadayda lukghumeeda ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea nimajeegiit sugoocheanduumeeda aba geatindaanyi, hean gwanuus fuga gadiyeeda ghayi nuus ghwaan was sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea miyeenuus diibigeaba fugiga ghayi nuus ghwaaniin, gawuurji gidaghayi sing'waarda aba jeeda gitaabooda deaweeda bea Musa bea gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba, “Majeenuus ghweaniga aba badayda giidiinyeanyeeka diibiga ghana diibiga aba badayda giidiinyeanyeeka ghweaniga. Ak gaygaba siisi meah aba riing'eadaanyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwanuus fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush bea eemeeda Edomu aba jeeda moangoachiyda balang'da. Ak ghoang'waay mujiineeda Sela aba ng'ucheeda, ak gaguura gheawungaaschi Yokteli ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakti Amasiya buuneeda heeda Yehoashi orjeeda Yehoahasi was orjeeda Yehu sugoocheanda Israeli nea gwayeesha, “Beeni eeroonyeena aba ng'ucheeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta Yehoashi was sugoocheanda Israeli siida heeda Amasiya was sugoocheanda Yuda ak gwayeesha, “Ghayi goojeakti geeta halaghweenga mida Lebanoni siida heeda gubooyeanda nea gwayeesha, ‘Nung' ghaghi orjeedeanyu hudaang'u.’ Iidu ghang'ata darideanda Lebanoni ak ghwala geetida bea halaghweengean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa nibwari fuga Edomu, ak aba seareani ea ning'unyi ghwarjeeda asi ghwara geaw, abiidana gheang'u. Ghwasaan anda gigasayi abuuta geaw jeeda sawanadeeda ak gajabeada ang'iing'i ea Yuda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Amasiya ea mooleeysiiniit ng'asheanji; hean ghwascheang'da Yehoashi was sugoocheanda Israeli gang'uchi sea Amasiya was sugoocheanda Yuda, aba Bet-shemeshi mida ng'eanyiida Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu fuga Yuda ghwajoar fuga Israeli ak gaba siisi fwach gawa gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'waay Yehoashi was sugoocheanda Israeli Amasiya was sugoocheanda Yuda orjeeda Yehoashi ea orjeeda Ahasiya aba Bet-shemeshi, ak ghwahidu Yerusalemu, ak gwanyarja ghamarda Yerusalemu. Geatin bughala, ghang'eada gheata dooshta Efraimu ea ghwahita heeda yamna geaw gheata dooshta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanda dahaabu sean siguura dahaabu, ea lapiya ea haleanjeeda sean mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gea heesiitiiwiisa haleanjeeda bea gheeda sugoocheanda, eara gea buuneeda, ak gabiikta Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi haleanjeeda sean sin Yehoashi ea meaynataanyi, ea gidang'ucheata sea Amasiya sugoocheanda Yuda, heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghami Yehoashi, ak geebung'sa heeda bung'eadinga sugoodiga Israeli mida Samariya. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda Yeroboamu was orjeedaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Amasiya was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Amasiya orjeeda Yoashi sugoocheanda Yuda goobiida gweanyeew damanamuut, iing'ata miyeeda Yehoashi orjeeda Yehoahasi sugoocheanda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Amasiya ea gea abit, heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geamwaal gichea eenuusta niny aba Yerusalemu, hean jeeng'u gamng'aw ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Lakishi, ng'ata geecheakta buuneeda eayaat geeshta ea eahita Lakishi ak geenuus aba hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geetiing'sa uhuuda faraasi ak geeyeadu ak geebung'sa Yerusalemu heeda bung'eadinga ghweanigaaschi aba mujiineeda Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaloat fuga sean bea Yuda Usiya, nea abeeda gaba gweanyeew damwalah. Ak geanung' ghoah sugoocheanda gawa hoorgeeda ghwaan was Amasiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadeas mujiineeda Elati, amang'ata ghoadealda heeda fuga Yuda, iing'ata miyeeda sugoocheanda sea ghweanigaaschi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamoodeaba iyeenya was sugoocheanda Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damanamuut bea Amasiya orjeeda Yoashi was sugoocheanda Yuda. Hean ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda Samariya Yeroboamu orjeeda Yehoashi was sugoocheanda Israeli, ak ghwaak gweanyeew haradam ea agi aba sugoocheanduumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea miighwanung'waada riing'eega sean bea Yeroboamu was orjeeda Nebati. Aba gideaba ghwanung' goodiiy fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goodeelu moonghooda ghayi bea fuga Israeli ghang'eada heeda sik Hamati ea ghwahita basooda Araba, gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli, aba ghuuta siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda was Yona orjeeda Amitayi was sibaneeda bea ng'eanyiida Gati-heferi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA ghwadaah sawanadeeda fuga Israeli aang'waan muuchi. Aba gideaba manda siida miigawa ghealooniga, nea manda siida weat fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea NG'UTAMIIDA ea miigwayi gaydanung' goosha fuga Israeli aba badayda ng'eanyiida. Hean ghoaghu saawa nea ghaweat Yeroboamu was orjeeda Yehoashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean bea Yeroboamu ghayi abit ea gea sin sean ea meaynataanyi ea gidang'ucheata. Ea gwanyaksa fuga Israeli Dameski ea Hamati, nea ghayi aba mwadi ea Yuda gil, heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
